    "category": "Prefix Sum",
    "difficulty": "Hard",
    "problemStatement": "Given an integer array nums and an integer p, remove the shortest non-empty subarray such that the sum of the remaining elements is divisible by p. Return the length of the shortest such subarray, or -1 if impossible.",
